    "note": "SubKit-first. SubKit implements 3.0; the five siblings still implement 2.3 until their own follow-up slices land. The deviation is deliberate and documented in COCKPIT-KONVENTION.md v2.1. The start page is called Übersicht (Overview) in all six products."
  },
  "apiSchemaVersion": "operational-overview.v1",
  "scope": [
    "shell",
    "auth",
    "not-found",
    "fatal-error",
    "attention",
    "collection",
